              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners, the law is constitutional because it aligns with prior child\u2011pornography precedents."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "e0609f71658fef7612e4b0d9df0c3fffed11f24367b810332df5e4bf9039df3e",
